# Synthetic-only: Build a sandbox policy that requires hardware/virtual MFA for every destructive delete or terminate action.
# This picture-first example always disables live AWS and apply, even if inherited.
# Run: lmctl https://raw.githubusercontent.com/lmctl-ai/lmaws/main/examples/recipe_policy_mfa_deletes.lms
